# Frontend

- Import API base and admin fetches from `@/lib/api` (`API_BASE`, `adminFetch`). Default `API_BASE` matches Compose (`localhost:8100`).
- Admin routes must use `credentials: "include"` (handled by `adminFetch`) so the httpOnly session cookie is sent to the API.
- Next.js 16 may differ from older docs; check `frontend/AGENTS.md` and project `node_modules/next` release notes when unsure.
- Unit tests: Vitest (`npm run test`). E2E: Playwright in `frontend/e2e/` (`npm run test:e2e` with Docker Compose up). ESLint: `npm run lint`.
